{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：Y在S01、S05这类短停留段，感受词密集且纵向交替，容易让观众来不及扫完；X的左右分栏更容易快速浏览。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y用高亮抓住每段叙事的关键转折，感受词又能随音乐到时出现，观众不必平均阅读所有文字，就能抓住人物心境的变化。它对人物从害怕暴露需要、享受亲近、担忧失去，到逐渐接受自己的喜欢，交代得更完整，音乐细节、身体感受和心理活动之间的对应也更细腻，反复出现的水波、小船意象还增强了整体连贯性。X胜在左右分栏带来的阅读效率，但部分音乐和情绪变化被概括掉了，综合体验我选Y。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "306489a7-dd96-4731-9ee6-b3dd6f2b087c", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261108T043139367174Z", "elapsed_seconds": 67.719, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T04:32:47.103767+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "e9e0c656cf6e6d5352b8b95ddd3202021f836bcc7382689fd3d15bd61cc3dd4d", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt